Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.56,0:00:06.52,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Another big moment in the young career of Sun Xinran.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N孙心然的职业生涯 又迎来重要时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.89,0:00:10.50,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}北京时间{\fs78}10{\fs68}月{\fs78}27{\fs68}号晚上 广州首轮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.50,0:00:11.99,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}{\fs78}16{\fs68}岁的孙心然
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.99,0:00:16.12,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}击败萨旺考 晋级{\fs78}16{\fs68}强
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.12,0:00:19.13,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}两天前 她还在成都捧杯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.21,0:00:21.34,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}{\fs78}10{\fs68}月{\fs78}25{\fs68}号
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.34,0:00:24.08,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}她刚在成都赢下{\fs78}18{\fs68}岁及以下组的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.08,0:00:25.53,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}年终总决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.53,0:00:27.07,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}第二天赶到广州
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.07,0:00:29.13,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}落地后就去适应场地
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.13,0:00:30.82,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}冠军来不及细细回味
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.82,0:00:33.10,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}新的考验已经到了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.17,0:00:35.30,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}{\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}领先
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.30,0:00:37.56,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}这一次她把反拍顶得很深
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.56,0:00:39.91,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}再沿着斜线寻找角度
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.91,0:00:41.81,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}萨旺考不断把球挡回来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.81,0:00:44.58,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}孙心然也没有急着一拍结束
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.32,0:00:50.32,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And the two-game cushion is back.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N两局的领先优势 又回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.32,0:00:55.38,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And look what the crowd think of it. They are delighted.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N看看现场观众的反应 他们太高兴了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.93,0:01:00.33,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}但{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68} 不是安全线
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.33,0:01:03.07,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}对手把她拉向边线 再突然放短
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.07,0:01:06.09,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}领先之后 仍要一分一分地守
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.10,0:01:10.23,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Beauty, absolute beauty.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N漂亮 太漂亮了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.23,0:01:13.12,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Sawangkaew is staying in touch.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N萨旺考仍然紧紧追着
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.45,0:01:16.21,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}盘末 她守住了这一局
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.26,0:01:19.40,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And there it is.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这一盘 拿下了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.60,0:01:21.40,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Holds to love.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N一分未丢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.00,0:01:23.24,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}First set on the board.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N首盘胜利 已经到手
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.49,0:01:26.00,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}在国际网联{\fs78}18{\fs68}岁及以下组
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.00,0:01:28.10,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}她已是女子世界第{\fs78}1{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.10,0:01:31.18,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}可职业赛场上 对面是世界第{\fs78}80{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.18,0:01:34.74,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}赢下一盘 不等于已经赢下整场
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.81,0:01:38.24,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}第二盘{\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68} 她继续把球打深
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.24,0:01:40.01,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}压住对手的底线
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.01,0:01:41.73,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}正反拍来回顶住之后
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.73,0:01:44.09,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}机会又落到她这一边
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.82,0:01:49.82,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And there is the break.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她又拿下了对手的发球局
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.32,0:01:52.70,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Sun Xinran!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N孙心然
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.13,0:01:54.50,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}领先来到{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.50,0:01:56.29,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}离胜利越来越近
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.29,0:01:58.82,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}可对手没有放弃 这个发球局
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.82,0:02:01.26,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}又被拖进漫长的拉锯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.58,0:02:41.68,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, what a point!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这一分 太精彩了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.72,0:02:44.63,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}What a way to win it as well.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N而且是用这样的方式拿下
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.96,0:02:48.06,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Again, the deft touch of Sawangkaew.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N又是萨旺考细腻的手感
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.08,0:02:53.60,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}One big serve away from a huge win.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N再来一个好发球 就有望赢下比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.44,0:03:06.40,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Another big moment in the young career of Sun Xinran.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N孙心然的职业生涯 又迎来重要时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.76,0:03:13.40,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}She topples Mananchaya Sawangkaew with relative ease.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她较为轻松地 击败了萨旺考
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.53,0:03:15.25,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}她低头走向网前
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.25,0:03:17.09,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}把掌声留在身后
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.09,0:03:20.28,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}两天前的冠军 没有让脚步停下来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.28,0:03:23.18,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}今晚 她又走稳了一步
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.25,0:03:25.69,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}制胜分{\fs78}9{\fs68}比{\fs78}17{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.69,0:03:28.70,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}非受迫性失误{\fs78}21{\fs68}比{\fs78}41{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.70,0:03:31.43,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}她不是打得更猛 而是少送机会
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.43,0:03:33.68,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}把优势守到了最后
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.73,0:03:37.57,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}成都夺冠 是一个新的起点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.57,0:03:39.10,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}把这一场胜利收好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.10,0:03:41.06,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}再迎接下一场挑战
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.06,0:03:44.64,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}{\fs78}16{\fs68}岁的她 还会带来什么惊喜？
